        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You create 20-foot-tall metal coils that harness the power of electricity, arcing current between two unoccupied spaces up to 30 feet apart. These coils each have AC 10, 60 Hit Points, and are immune to critical hits and precision damage. The spell ends if either coil is destroyed. A constant stream of electricity flows between these coils in a visible, straight line. Creatures can see and move through the coils; however, if a creature enters or starts its turn in the stream of electricity or within 5 feet of a coil, it takes 4d12 electricity damage with a basic Reflex save. On a failed save, the target is also @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Off-Guard] for 1 round.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d12.</p>"
